Do exactly these steps, in order, and nothing else: 1) Use the Agent tool with subagent_type Explore and the prompt 'Use the Read tool to read src/ratelimit.py and reply with the value of LIMIT only.' 2) When the subagent has answered, use the Read tool to read src/settings.ini. 3) Use the Edit tool to change "window_seconds = 60" to "window_seconds = 30" in src/settings.ini. 4) Reply with the single word: done
